WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.296 --> 00:00:03.528
(wind blowing)

00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:04.361
- You're probably asking yourself

00:00:04.361 --> 00:00:08.030
why I'm dangling off a rope a
thousand feet off the ground.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:09.660
I'm asking the same question.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.010
Well, Disney wanted to make
a show about longevity.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:14.013
Turns out this has
something to do with it.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.093
Here we go.

00:00:17.229 --> 00:00:19.979
(dramatic music)

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:23.903
I'm getting older now.

00:00:25.866 --> 00:00:29.870
I don't feel invincible.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.230
It makes me want to push
myself to such an extreme

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.450
and live as long as I can

00:00:35.964 --> 00:00:40.105
and continue to make the
most of every moment.

00:00:40.105 --> 00:00:42.938
(inspiring music)

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:50.660
- if you push yourself beyond the point

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.060
at which you should be coming out,

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.730
there is a real risk you could die.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.000
- Why am I doing this?

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.153
Why am I doing this?

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:58.890
- What's making you nervous?

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.173
- Ah, death is usually the big one, yeah.

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:08.010
Whoa.
(dramatic music)

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.860
- We want to make you so resilient.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:11.940
- [Doctor] How can we be
present with our stress now

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.240
so that it doesn't kill us later?

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.070
- So strong, so powerful.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:17.030
- If this is going to challenge your body,

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:18.400
it'll challenge your brain, too.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.470
- That you can go toe
to toe with Father Time,

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.220
and he's not even gonna bother you.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:27.290
- We change your body to
do a reboot on your system.

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:30.861
- You know, we're basically
gonna need Chris Hemsworth 2.0.

00:01:30.861 --> 00:01:32.485
- The new me.

00:01:32.485 --> 00:01:35.318
(inspiring music)

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:42.013
Let's get on with it, shall we?

00:01:42.013 --> 00:01:44.596
(upbeat music)

